OL,3,GNEWSAClarkson's Farm's Kaleb Cooper
OL,4,Areports sheep attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FClarkson's Farm star Kaleb Cooper has
OL,7,Freported an attack on his livestock by
OL,8,Fa dog that was off its lead to police.
OL,10,FIn a post on Instagram over the
OL,11,Fweekend, the 28-year-old farmer said
OL,12,Fthe incident had taken place at around
OL,13,F22:30 GMT Friday evening.
OL,15,FCooper, who is Jeremy Clarkson's
OL,16,Fassistant on the former Top Gear
OL,17,Fpresenter's farm in Oxfordshire, said
OL,18,Fthe attack had left four of his sheep
OL,19,Finjured.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
