OL,3,GNEWSAClarkson's Farm's Kaleb Cooper
OL,4,Areports sheep attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he had reported the incident to
OL,7,FThames Valley Police, and urged people:
OL,8,F"Just keep your dog on the lead at all
OL,9,Ftimes when there's livestock around."
